reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-237-       requires I >Int 0
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-238-  rule setVSAt(VS:ValSeq, I:Int, _:Val)             => VS
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-239-       requires I <Int 0
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-240-endmodule
