reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k-54-  rule revVSAcc(.ValSeq, A:ValSeq) => A
reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k:55:  rule revVSAcc(vCons(V:Val, R:ValSeq), A:ValSeq) => revVSAcc(R, vCons(V, A))
reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k-56-
reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k-57-  syntax ValSeq ::= condRev(ValSeq, Bool) [function, total]
reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k-58-  rule condRev(S:ValSeq, false) => S
