reference-semantics/semantics/list.k-7-
reference-semantics/semantics/list.k-8-  // ==== iteration (the iterator protocol's list case) =======================
reference-semantics/semantics/list.k:9:  rule <k> #iterNext(list(.ValSeq))                => #iterDone ... </k>
reference-semantics/semantics/list.k:10:  rule <k> #iterNext(list(vCons(V:Val, R:ValSeq))) => #iterYield(V, list(R)) ... </k>
reference-semantics/semantics/list.k-11-
