reference-semantics/semantics/list.k-27-  rule applyCmp("==", list(A:ValSeq), list(B:ValSeq)) => A ==K B
reference-semantics/semantics/list.k-28-  rule applyCmp("!=", list(A:ValSeq), list(B:ValSeq)) => notBool (A ==K B)
reference-semantics/semantics/list.k-29-
reference-semantics/semantics/list.k-30-  // ==== deep equality when elements are heap objects (list-of-lists) ========
